+% PROPOSED AMENDMENT -- NOT APPLIED. Requires author approval before registration.
+\paragraph{Proposed inference-time harness amendment (dev only).}
+We propose evaluating an unchanged trained checkpoint under the existing prompt,
+file-rendered rules, rules plus a skills index with on-demand loading, and rules
+plus all skill bodies injected. Configuration selection uses only the fixed
+training-derived dev split, with paired episodes on identical images, seeds,
+tool budgets, geometry and decoding settings. No selection uses the held-out
+DENTEX test set. Pre-registered primary metrics are pooled exact F1 and
+invented-findings rate (unmatched predicted findings divided by all predicted
+findings; undefined if there are no predictions). Paired image bootstrap
+intervals accompany condition differences; format failures and tool usage are
+reported alongside these metrics. Claims remain pending until measured.
